    <string name="icloud_no_tags_title">No tags owned by this account</string>
    <string name="icloud_no_tags_body">Tags are registered by an iPhone or iPad, and only that account can unlock them. This account has no device that can.</string>
    <string name="icloud_no_tags_shared_note"><b>If a friend shared their tags with you in Find My</b>, that sharing does not include the keys this app needs. Ask them to export a bundle for you, and import it here.</string>
    <string name="icloud_service_unsure_title">Could not check your account just now</string>
    <string name="icloud_service_unsure_body">Apple reported nothing usable at all, which usually means the service is having a bad day rather than anything being wrong with your account. Worth trying again later.</string>
